{"id":1745646,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:49:40.363Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745646,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Utusan Cinta Buat Adam","overview":"# The Story of Aireen Husna and Adam Firdaus  The story tells of Aireen Husna, an architect who frequently encounters Adam Firdaus at the mosque she regularly visits. Aireen falls in love with Adam even though she cannot identify who he really is. Aireen dreams of a devout husband and yearns for a love as pure as the love between Prophet Muhammad and Siti Khadijah. Impressed by Siti Khadijah's sincerity in winning over the Prophet, Aireen begins to inquire about Adam's identity and proposes to him. Adam is confused by Aireen's proposal. Pressure from Tok Wan who wants Adam to marry Liyana does not please Adam. However, in the end, Adam chooses to accept Aireen's proposal. Adam's agreement to marry Aireen delights all family members except Tok Wan, who feels Adam is being disrespectful. Tok Wan is angry that Adam has rejected her choice. Her anger escalates when Adam and Aireen remain together despite her efforts to prevent it.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/fPDhcSY9m6CJBZca0qKidM5Lhkt.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":122496,"logo_path":null,"name":"A-Ten Alliances Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Utusan Cinta Buat Adam","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1280220,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Kamal Adli","original_name":"Kamal Adli","popularity":0.8151,"profile_path":"/yWcXwMX0UrlbY1HbEVAXyUbaWEm.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a769cee5e69cf6c5ce849ab","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":17388